*** Keywords ***
Recovery actions for BTS
    [Documentation]     Recovery actions for BTS.
    ...                 Used with default arguments can cover scenarios:
    ...                 * If testline does not have OnAir state - it will preform BTS Site Reset
    ...                 * If BTS Configuration Error appears - it will try to restore base SCF if present in TestLines
    ...                 dedicated catalogue.
    [Arguments]         ${bts_type}=GNB
    ...                 ${recover_to_onair}=${True}
    ...                 ${teardown_for_fault_10}=${False}
    ...                 ${power_reset_bts}=${False}
    ...                 ${du_id}=0
    ${configuration_error}              Private Detect BTS Configuration Error
    ...                                 bts_type=${bts_type}

    run keyword if                      ${configuration_error}
    ...                                 Perform recommissioning to base SCF
    ...                                 bts_type=${bts_type}

    run keyword if                      ${power_reset_bts}
    ...                                 Perform Device Unit Power Reset Recovery
    ...                                 bts_type=${bts_type}

    run keyword if                      ${teardown_for_fault_10}
    ...                                 Perform Fault 10 Recovery
    ...                                 bts_type=${bts_type}

    run keyword if                      ${recover_to_onair}
    ...                                 Perform Reset Site Recovery
    ...                                 bts_type=${bts_type}

Handle Diagnostic Files Collected
    [Documentation]  Handles Diagnostic Files collected fault by gathering snapshot and if needed
    ...              waiting 15 minutes (as NIDD states) until alarm disappear.
    [Arguments]                             ${bts_type}=GNB
    ${fault_6450_status}=                   Alarms.Is alarm active
    ...                                     fault_id=6450
    ...                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Run Keyword If                          ${fault_6450_status}
    ...                                     Robot Log Warning
    ...        msg=Diagnostic Files Collected fault (fid=6450) detected, gathering snapshot to clear the alarm.

    Run Keyword If                          ${fault_6450_status}
    ...                                     Collect snapshot
    ...                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${fault_6450_status}=                   Alarms.Is alarm active
    ...                                     fault_id=6450
    ...                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Run keyword if                          ${fault_6450_status}
    ...                                     Robot Log Warning
    ...             msg=Diagnostic Files Collected fault is still there, waiting up to 15 minutes until alarm disappear.

    wait until keyword succeeds             15min  30s  Alarms.Wait for inactive alarm     fault_id=6450
    ...                                                                                    bts_type=${bts_type}

